**Note**: To implement this theme:

1. Apply global blue-gray color palette
2. Set up primary lighting from top-left with sharp shadows
3. Add 3 bat silhouettes circling dramatically in mid-distance
4. Enable subtle Bat-signal projection visible through environmental haze
5. Apply medium fog density with slight volumetric light scattering
6. Add light rain effect with reflective surface puddles
7. Position camera low with slight Dutch angle
8. Start deep, resonant orchestral score
9. Set all UI elements to 10% opacity/size with dark outlines
10. Render with cinematic aspect ratio (2.35:1) and black bars

This view will maintain visibility of the core interface while immersing the user in the cinematic Gotham atmosphere at the requested 10% view scale.

